#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.desktop.in:2
msgid "Penfold"
msgstr "Penfold"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.desktop.in:3
msgid "PDF Editor"
msgstr "Editor de PDF"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.desktop.in:4
msgid "Read, annotate and organize your PDFs"
msgstr "Lee, anota y organiza tus PDF"

#. Translators: search terms for the app, separated by semicolons. Keep the final semicolon.
#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.desktop.in:6
msgid "PDF;annotate;highlight;merge;bookmarks;form;"
msgstr "PDF;anotar;resaltar;combinar;marcadores;formulario;"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.desktop.in:17
msgid "New Window"
msgstr "Nueva ventana"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "Read, annotate and organize PDFs"
msgstr "Lee, anota y organiza tus PDF"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Penfold is a simple PDF reader that can also add annotations and work with "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Penfold es un lector sencillo de archivos PDF con capacidad para añadir "
"anotaciones y manipular páginas."

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Add pages from other PDFs, and blank pages"
msgstr "Añadir páginas de otros PDF y páginas en blanco"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Merge files into a single file"
msgstr "Combinar archivos en un único archivo"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Pages: reorder, extract, delete and rotate"
msgstr "Páginas: reordenar, extraer, eliminar y girar"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Bookmarks: add, rename and reorder"
msgstr "Marcadores: añadir, renombrar y reordenar"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Annotations: highlights, underlines and strikethroughs"
msgstr "Anotaciones: resaltados, subrayados y tachados"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Graphic elements: comments, text boxes, rectangles, circles and arrows"
msgstr ""
"Elementos gráficos: comentarios, cuadros de texto, cuadros, círculos y "
"flechas"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"Forms: fill them in, and save them to keep editing later or flattened to "
"send them"
msgstr ""
"Formularios: rellenarlos y guardarlos para seguir editándolos o aplanados "
"para enviarlos"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:24
msgid ""
"Annotations are saved with their own drawing, so they look the same in other "
"PDF viewers. Penfold works without an internet connection and never runs the "
"code (JavaScript) that a PDF may contain."
msgstr ""
"Las anotaciones se guardan con su propio dibujo, para que se vean igual en "
"otros visores de PDF. Penfold funciona sin conexión a internet y nunca "
"ejecuta el código (JavaScript) que pueda llevar un PDF."

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:32
msgid "annotate"
msgstr "anotar"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:33
msgid "highlight"
msgstr "resaltar"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:34
msgid "merge"
msgstr "combinar"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:42
msgid "Bookmarks panel and two-page view"
msgstr "Panel de marcadores y vista de dos páginas"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:46
msgid "Thumbnail view"
msgstr "Vista de miniaturas"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:50
msgid "Annotations panel"
msgstr "Panel de anotaciones"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:54
msgid "Filling in a form"
msgstr "Rellenar un formulario"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid "Merging PDFs"
msgstr "Combinar PDF"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:62
msgid "Extracting pages"
msgstr "Extraer páginas"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:66
msgid "Choosing which annotations to print"
msgstr "Elegir qué anotaciones se imprimen"

#: data/io.github.ibanurq.Penfold.metainfo.xml.in:77
msgid ""
"First stable version: read, annotate and organize PDFs, merge files, extract "
"pages and fill in forms."
msgstr ""
"Primera versión estable: leer, anotar y organizar PDF, combinar archivos, "
"extraer páginas y rellenar formularios."

